WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,440
Stop, let me go

2
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:05,040
I left it to you, the third prince.

3
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:07,980
You do this to your third prince

4
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:09,140
Won't you be sad?

5
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,700
So what if he is sad

6
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:12,420
I just want to live

7
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:17,940
What a pity

8
00:00:18,890 --> 00:00:21,240
What does it mean when you meet me?

9
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:22,520
what does it mean

10
00:00:24,590 --> 00:00:28,210
If it were someone else, you might be able to live and I would give it to you.

11
00:00:28,950 --> 00:00:30,030
five beasts

12
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:31,110
Kill an enemy

13
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:33,230
Gain attributes one point five times

14
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:41,700
let me go

15
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:44,870
I still have a wife and two children at home.

16
00:00:45,030 --> 00:00:46,190
please

17
00:00:46,350 --> 00:00:47,390
don't kill me

18
00:00:47,550 --> 00:00:52,510
I want to save me
